# AI Finance Controller — Razorpay Buildathon Track 04

## Project
A 3-way financial reconciliation agent that matches records across
BankTransaction, LedgerEntry, and SettlementRecord tables, using
Groq (Gemini failover) for ambiguous-match reasoning, and reports a
measured match rate plus an honest, explained exception list for
unresolved records.

