## Stack — DO NOT DEVIATE
- Backend: Node.js + Express (TypeScript) in `server/`
- Frontend: React (TypeScript, Vite) in `client/`
- Database: PostgreSQL via Docker Compose at project root
  - image: `postgres:16.6`
  - container_name: `aifc_postgres`
  - named volume: `aifc_pgdata` (persists across restarts)
  - credentials: `aifc_user` / `aifc_dev_pw` / db `ai_finance_controller`
  - host port: 5432
- ORM: Prisma **6.x** (`prisma` + `@prisma/client` pinned ~6.19)
  - NEVER upgrade to Prisma 8 / Composer CLI
  - Schema + migrations only under `server/prisma/`
  - Shared client: `server/src/db/prisma.ts`
- LLM: **Groq primary** (`groq-sdk`, `GROQ_API_KEY`, default model
  `openai/gpt-oss-20b` via `GROQ_MODEL`). **Failover only:** Gemini
  (`@google/generative-ai`, `GEMINI_API_KEY`) on Groq
  quota/429/503/model_not_found/json_validate_failed (or missing key).
  Groq JSON failures: recover `failed_generation` → one repair retry →
  then Gemini failover. NEVER LangChain/LlamaIndex. NEVER silently
  switch primary to OpenAI/Claude or back to Gemini without an explicit
  user request.
- Package manager: npm (install inside `server/` or `client/`)

## Local DB rules
- Start DB with: `docker compose up -d` from project root.
